# Getaway Glamer {W}, Spree: both modes ({W} + {1} + {2} = four mana). "No matter which modes you choose, you always follow the
# instructions in the order they are written": the first mode exiles Bot2's Giant Cindermaw (4 power, the only creature that
# outpowered the Spirit tokens), and only then is the second mode's power compared - Bot1's Spirit token (1/1) now ties Bot2's
# Memnite for the greatest power and is destroyed. The Cindermaw returns to Bot2 as the end step begins.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Lingering Souls
Getaway Glamer
Memnite
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Giant Cindermaw
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island
Island x13

